 price range, which is useful during multi-day outages. However, the listing says it is a preorder shipping December 7, so I would not choose it for immediate emergency preparedness. \ue200cite\ue202turn972576search0\ue201\n\n## How long will a 1,000\u20131,150Wh kit run appliances?\n\nThese are approximate runtimes from a fully charged battery, assuming 85% usable energy after conversion losses and no solar recharging.\n\n| Appliance | Estimated runtime |\n|--------|--------|\n| Wi-Fi router (15W) | 55\u201365 hours |\n| LED lights (40W total) | 21\u201324 hours |\n| Refrigerator (60W average) | 14\u201316 hours |\n| CPAP (40W) |  |"}],"c":14}  

